        "name": "Stranglethorns",
        "maxRank": 3,
        "summary": "Zyra summons a twisted thicket at her target location, dealing damage to enemies as it expands and knocking them airborne as it contracts. Plants within the thicket are enraged.",
        "bodyHtml": "Zyra summons the fury of nature, growing a twisted thicket that deals <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(200/300/400 + (70% Ability Power)) magic damage</span>. After 2 seconds, the vines snap upwards, <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Knocking Up</span> for 1 second.<br /><br />Zyra's plants within the thicket become enraged, resetting their duration, gaining <span class=\"text-green-600 dark:text-green-400\">50% Health</span> and Attacking for 50% bonus damage.",
